{
  "version": 3,
  "note": "上游协议形状的唯一事实来源。改端点、改参数、改 body 结构、改变签名策略，都只改这个文件。Kotlin 侧由 protocol/Endpoints.kt 读取。query 用数组而不是对象：签名覆盖 query 的字节顺序，顺序是协议的一部分，不能被 JSON 对象的重排吞掉。模板里的 $name 全部是占位符（path/query/body 通用），body 中不要出现字面量 $；path 占位符的值要求调用方已按 urlEncode 编码，query 占位符由 PlainSigner 统一编码、调用方传原文。",
  "hosts": {
    "content": "https://api5-normal-sinfonlinea.fqnovel.com",
    "stream": "https://api5-normal-sinfonlineb.fqnovel.com",
    "site": "https://hongguoduanju.com"
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "suggest": {
      "host": "site",
      "path": "/incent_resource/suggestion",
      "method": "GET",
      "signer": "none",
      "queryProfile": "none",
      "query": [
        [
          "app_id",
          "8662"
        ],
        [
          "query",
          "$keyword"
        ],
        [
          "count",
          "10"
        ]
      ],
      "note": "官网联想词：免签名、免设备注册、约 70ms。app_id 必填（缺了 500），query 空值也 500；count 有效上限 20。video_data 是卡片，空对象表示只能当查询词。"
    },
    "seasonLine": {
      "host": "content",
      "path": "/reading/bookapi/plan/v:version/",
      "method": "GET",
      "signer": "full",
      "queryProfile": "device",
      "query": [
        [
          "scene",
          "10"
        ],
        [
          "from",
          "detail_page_more_related"
        ],
        [
          "book_id",
          "$seriesId"
        ],
        [
          "limit",
          "0"
        ],
        [
          "offset",
          "0"
        ]
      ],
      "note": "详情页「相关作品」cell（show_type=547）。季数排序的唯一事实来源；同 IP 卡片解析但不展示。设备身份必须是未被拉黑的一对（见 DeviceIdentity）。"
    },
    "detail": {
      "host": "content",
      "path": "/novel/player/video_detail/v1/",
      "method": "POST",
      "signer": "full",
      "queryProfile": "device",
      "query": [],
      "body": "{\"biz_param\":{\"detail_page_version\":1,\"disable_digg_stat\":false,\"disable_video_relate_book\":false,\"need_all_video_definition\":false,\"need_mp4_align\":false,\"screen_width_px\":\"1920\",\"source\":5,\"use_os_player\":false,\"use_server_dns\":false,\"video_id_type\":1},\"series_id\":\"$seriesId\"}",
      "note": "全集顺序即播出顺序，本地不重排。官网详情页 2026-10-23 起只下发前 10 集（visible_episode_cnt），所以分集清单只能用这个接口。"
    },
    "siteSearch": {
      "host": "site",
      "path": "/api/search/result",
      "method": "GET",
      "signer": "none",
      "queryProfile": "none",
      "query": [
        [
          "aid",
          "8662"
        ],
        [
          "query",
          "$keyword"
        ],
        [
          "page",
          "$page"
        ]
      ],
      "note": "官网 2026-10-23 起换 React SPA，SSR 的 _ROUTER_DATA 整个不再下发；这是页面自己调的接口（HTML 里 search.*.js）。page 有效、一页固定 10 条，totalPages 可达 21。keyword 传原文，编码由 PlainSigner 统一做。"
    },
    "videoModel": {
      "host": "stream",
      "path": "/novel/player/video_model/v1/",
      "method": "POST",
      "signer": "full",
      "queryProfile": "device",
      "query": [],
      "body": "{\"video_id\":\"$vid\",\"biz_param\":{\"detail_page_version\":0,\"device_level\":3,\"disable_digg_stat\":false,\"need_all_video_definition\":true,\"need_mp4_align\":false,\"use_os_player\":false,\"use_server_dns\":false,\"video_platform\":1024}}",
      "note": "播放地址第一候选（2026-10-14 起的当前路由）。body 只认 video_id 单值：给 mixed_video_id_map / vid / 数组一律 100001 或 400。设备身份被拉黑时回 200 空体——这正是旧实现「所有影片都放不了」的真正原因，不是端点下线。"
    }
  }
}
